usage: harborrl [-h] [-model MODEL] [-harness HARNESS] [-task TASK] [-alg ALG]
                [--config CONFIG_OPTION] [--set SET] [--dry-run]
                {train,doctor} [config_path]

Public entry point for the native HarborRL training pipeline.

positional arguments:
  {train,doctor}
  config_path           YAML configuration file

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -model MODEL          Slime model preset to select
  -harness HARNESS      agent harness to select
  -task TASK            task ID to select from the locked catalog
  -alg ALG              training algorithm to select
  --config CONFIG_OPTION
                        YAML configuration file
  --set SET
  --dry-run
